WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Connecting rod bearing shell
What it does: Provides the sliding surface separated from the journal by pressurised oil.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Connecting rod bearing shell
How it works: Oil enters from the crankshaft.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Connecting rod bearing shell
How it moves: Retained in the connecting rod and moves with it; the journal slides relative to the bearing.
